   <media:description>VILLA ZEGNA Los Angeles draws inspiration from the way the Zegna family traveled throughout the 1970s. 

Guests enter as if arriving at a private summer residence from another era. Inside, a sequence of immersive environments unfolds like fragments of a collective family album.

Inside the villa, characters quietly inhabit the space as if suspended in time: a gardener caring for the plants, a butler welcoming guests, a bartender preparing the family’s favorite cocktails. 

The line between cinema and reality slowly dissolves, turning the experience into something deeply atmospheric, emotional, and human.

#VILLAZEGNA</media:description>
